---
description: Main app spec-driven workflow
globs:
  - apps/app/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

When working in `apps/app`:

1. Read `apps/app/AGENTS.md`
2. Read `apps/app/docs/AGENTS.md`
3. Read `apps/app/docs/progress-tracker.md`
4. Read the relevant feature spec from `apps/app/docs/feature-specs/`

Before finishing:

- Update `apps/app/docs/progress-tracker.md`
- Update `apps/app/docs/feature-specs/00-index.md` if feature status changed
- Run the relevant validation command when code changed

Do not consider the task complete until the tracker is updated.
